        <body>
            <div type="edition" subtype="primary" xml:space="preserve" xml:lang="grc" resp="#VM #JP">
                <ab>
                    <lb n="1"/><persName type="divine"><name><supplied reason="lost">Δάματ</supplied>ρι</name></persName> καὶ <persName type="divine"><name>Κόρᾳ</name></persName>
                    <lb n="2"/><gap reason="lost" extent="unknown" unit="character"/> <persName type="attested"><name><supplied reason="lost">Π</supplied>ρωτοφάνεος</name></persName>
                    <lb n="3"/><gap reason="lost" extent="unknown" unit="character"/><unclear>χ</unclear>ος <persName type="attested"><name>Ἀρτεμιδώρ<supplied reason="lost">ου</supplied></name></persName>
                    <lb n="4"/><gap reason="lost" extent="unknown" unit="character"/><persName type="attested"><name><w part="F">ρ<supplied reason="lost">ο</supplied>υ</w></name></persName>
                    <lb n="5"/><gap reason="lost" extent="unknown" unit="character" cert="low"/>
                </ab>
            </div>
            <div type="apparatus">
                <listApp>
                    <app>
                        <note>Text controlled by Prag against photograph</note>
                    </app>
                    <app loc="3"><note>Gentili 1959-1960, 1961: ΚΟΣ</note></app>
                    <app loc="4"><note>Gentili 1959-1960: [---]ΡΙΟΥ; Gentili 1961: [---]ΩΡΟΥ</note></app>
                </listApp>
            </div>
            <div type="translation">
                <p></p>
            </div>
            <div type="commentary">
                <p>The stone records a high quality dedication to Demeter and Kore, seemingly by at least three individuals, listed with names and patronymics. From what is preserved of the rear of the block, there was clearly room for at least one more line of text, but perhaps more, since Gentili suggests the base was damaged and perhaps entirely lost - this, as a minimum, likely contained the verb for dedication, but could have included other information, such as the capacity in which the individuals were acting.</p>
            </div>
